  "conversion": "GLTFLoader; bake world transforms, retain separate anatomical meshes, round coordinates to 0.1 micrometre. Original source colors; warmer ovarian surface color. No source scripts executed.",
  "registration": "Axis-aligned registration of HRA female pelvis to the adapted MakeHuman hip bones and sacrum. Educational fit; not a clinical registration.",
  "articulations": "All added organs follow female pelvis with its own bind matrix. Female ureter distal endpoints follow HRA bladder orifices with a smooth transition.",
  "reconstructions": [
    {
      "name": "Vagina",
      "method": "Own flattened double-wall canal, fornices and simplified internal folds, connected to HRA cervix; not HRA segmentation."
    },
